  "blocks": {
    "\"It's stuck looping on the failing test.\"": "“它卡在失败测试上不断循环。”",
    "\"Just clear it — start a fresh session with the plan doc and the test file. No point fighting the existing context.\"": "“直接清空——用计划文档和测试文件开始一个新会话。没必要继续和现有上下文较劲。”",
    "Clearing doesn't erase the conversation. Most harnesses keep session history on your computer, so the transcript is still there to read or resume. What's gone is the agent's working state: the model is stateless, so the new session knows nothing the old one knew. If the session holds decisions or progress the next one will need, have the agent write a handoff artifact first, then start the new session by pointing at it.": "清空不会删除对话记录。大多数<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/harness\">运行框架</a>会把会话历史保存在本机，因此记录仍可阅读或恢复。真正消失的是智能体的工作状态：模型是<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/stateless\">无状态</a>的，新会话不知道旧会话掌握的任何内容。如果当前会话包含下一次会话需要的决策或进展，应先让智能体写一份<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/handoff-artifact\">交接产物</a>，再让新会话从该文档开始。",
    "Clearing is the cure for a polluted context. A session accumulates everything: failed attempts, wrong turns, stale tool results, abandoned plans. The model re-reads all of it on every turn, and bad history drags on new work. Deep into a long session the agent gets vaguer and less obedient — instructions you gave clearly get ignored, quality slips, and prodding it to do better doesn't help, because the noise it's wading through is still in its context. Clearing removes the noise.": "清空是治理受污染<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context\">上下文</a>的方法。会话会累积一切：失败尝试、错误方向、过时的<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool-result\">工具结果</a>和已经放弃的计划。<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/model\">模型</a>会在每个<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/turn\">轮次</a>重新阅读全部历史，糟糕历史会拖累新工作。长会话深入进行后，<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agent\">智能体</a>会变得更加含糊、更不遵守指令——明确给出的要求被忽略，质量下滑，催促它“做得更好”也无济于事，因为它仍在同一堆上下文噪声中跋涉。清空可以移除这些噪声。",
    "Compare compaction, which summarises the session into the new context instead of starting empty. Clearing is the blunter tool: nothing carries over, including the junk.": "与<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/compaction\">压缩</a>相比，压缩会先总结会话，再把摘要放入新上下文，而不是从空白开始。清空更直接：任何内容都不延续，包括垃圾。",
    "Ending the current session and starting a fresh one. The next message begins with an empty session and an empty context window. Usually user-driven.": "清空是结束当前<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/session\">会话</a>并开始一个全新会话。下一条消息会从空会话和空<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context-window\">上下文窗口</a>开始，通常由用户主动触发。",
    "Usage:": "<em>用法：</em>"
  },
